},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"中島公園","category":"nature","address":"蓮田市","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"11238","municipality_pref":"埼玉県","municipality_name":"蓮田市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.65440203,36.00138572]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"綾瀬南児童公園","category":"nature","address":"蓮田市","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"11238","municipality_pref":"埼玉県","municipality_name":"蓮田市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.64450243,35.98019663]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"中谷公園","category":"nature","address":"蓮田市","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"11238","municipality_pref":"埼玉県","municipality_name":"蓮田市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.65331655,36.01004169]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"上沼","category":"nature","address":"湖沼景観 / 湖沼","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"11238","municipality_pref":"埼玉県","municipality_name":"蓮田市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"701"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.67884826660156,35.987388610839844]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"下沼","category":"nature","address":"湖沼景観 / 湖沼","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"11238","municipality_pref":"埼玉県","municipality_name":"蓮田市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"701"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.68191528320312,35.983516693115234]}}],"display_comment_original":"蓮田市周辺には、近世村の記憶として上蓮田村、下蓮田村、貝塚村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には古墳や貝塚、寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、江ヶ崎城跡、雅楽谷遺跡、関山貝塚のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、上蓮田村、下蓮田村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["飯野喜四郎"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["芥川龍之介自撰自筆の碑","西城沼公園","コスモスまつり","雅楽谷の森フェスティバル","江ヶ崎城跡","閏戸の式三番（埼玉県指定無形民俗文化財）","関山貝塚・黒浜貝塚","蓮田市文化財展示館"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%93%AE%E7%94%B0%E5%B8%82","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11666708"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"蓮田市","wikipedia_revision_id":"110631063","wikidata_qid":"Q857256","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%93%AE%E7%94%B0%E5%B8%82","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}